[scene format=1]

; A night sea for the style switch: Water3D under a low moon with no ProceduralSky (the water takes the world's first
; DirectionalLight3D), a dark sky colour, a rock on the horizon. Its backdrop lights the highway (environment) and
; comes in with the highway's screen-space reflections turned on (SSR and ssr_backdrop), as a style change does.

